      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792533398997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Every pod sends to the otel-agent on\nits own node. Agents forward to one\notel-gateway, which writes to\nPrometheus, Tempo and Loki.\n\n2. SDK injected by the OTel Operator:\ntraces, logs with trace_id, metrics with\nexemplars",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Every pod sends to the otel-agent on its own node. Agents forward to one otel-gateway, which writes to Prometheus, Tempo and Loki.\n\n2. SDK injected by the OTel Operator: traces, logs with trace_id, metrics with exemplars",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    }
  ],
